TMDB attribution asset

This is the unmodified TMDB "Primary short (blue)" SVG approved for API attribution.
Official source and brand guidance: https://www.themoviedb.org/about/logos-attribution
The asset is included solely to identify Isolde's use of the TMDB API. Do not recolor,
distort, or imply endorsement. The application displays TMDB's required notice in its
About section: "This product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB."

TMDB's API terms distinguish non-commercial developer use from commercial use. Confirm
that the applicable API license covers the intended deployment/distribution before
release; a production token does not itself grant commercial rights.
